    "1.3. Changelog",
    "<a id=\"ch-intro-changelog\" name=\"ch-intro-changelog\"></a>1.3. Changelog",
    "This is version 12.4 of the Linux From Scratch book, dated September 1st, 2025. If this book is more than six months old, a newer and better version is probably already available. To find out, please check one of the mirrors via <a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mirrors.html\">https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mirrors.html</a>.",
    "Below is a list of changes made since the previous release of the book.",
